  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131nda g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm kadar\u0131yla burcun {{burc}}, \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki
    {{sabit_sayi,4,14}} g\xFCn boyunca {{kelime, terazi, ko\xE7, o\u011Flak ve yenge\xE7
    gibi \"\xF6nc\xFC\" di\u011Fer bur\xE7lar\u0131n | bo\u011Fa, aslan, akrep ve
    kova gibi \"sabit\" di\u011Fer bur\xE7lar\u0131n | ikizler, ba\u015Fak, yay ve
    bal\u0131k gibi \"de\u011Fi\u015Fken\" di\u011Fer bur\xE7lar\u0131n}} negatif
    etkileri alt\u0131nda olacak. Bu bur\xE7lara mensup insanlarla {{sayi,1,3}} saatten
    fazla yan yana geldi\u011Finde enerjin so\u011Furuluyormu\u015F gibi hissedebilir,
    g\xFCn sonunda halsiz kalabilirsin. Telvelerin, mecbur kalmad\u0131k\xE7a bu
    ki\u015Filerle d\xF6rt duvar aras\u0131na girmekten {{sabit_sayi,4,14}} g\xFCn
    boyunca ka\xE7\u0131nman\u0131 tavsiye ediyor {{isim}}. Bunu ba\u015Faramayacaksan,
    \xFCzerinde bir \"{{kelime, akik ta\u015F\u0131 | ye\u015Fim ta\u015F\u0131 |
    ametist ta\u015F\u0131 | apatit ta\u015F\u0131 | akuamarin ta\u015F\u0131 | aragonit
    ta\u015F\u0131 | y\u0131ld\u0131z ta\u015F\u0131 | amazon ta\u015F\u0131 | kan
    ta\u015F\u0131 | amber ta\u015F\u0131 | azurit ta\u015F\u0131 | krizokol ta\u015F\u0131
    | sitrin ta\u015F\u0131 | garnet ta\u015F\u0131 | hematit ta\u015F\u0131 | labradorit
    ta\u015F\u0131 | lacivert ta\u015F\u0131 | krisopraz ta\u015F\u0131 | bak\u0131r
    ta\u015F\u0131 | ay ta\u015F\u0131 | morganit ta\u015F\u0131 | oniks ta\u015F\u0131
    | rodokrozit ta\u015F\u0131 | peridot ta\u015F\u0131 | kuartz ta\u015F\u0131
    | obsidyan ta\u015F\u0131 | zebercet ta\u015F\u0131 | kehribar ta\u015F\u0131}}\"
    bulundurman\u0131n koruyucu faydas\u0131 olacakt\u0131r."
